0..75 Comment "// What a dependent arrow whose codomain names its binder refuses: it is no"
76..152 Comment "// plain arrow (#577). A family that reads to a type over its argument stays"
153..230 Comment "// a dependent codomain once it is read, so a function over it does not stand"
231..263 Comment "// at the arrow to any one type."
